400 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Soil testing is one of the most important due diligence documents in any land purchase\056 It tells you what you are actually buying beneath the surface \024 load\055bearing capacity\054 drainage\054 groundwater\054 and whether the land can support what you intend to build\056 The fact that most developers treat it as proprietary information is not an accident\056 It is a choice\056 We explain what soil testing means\054 how to read a report\054 and why Oltraya publishes its results by default\056)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 401 0 R
     /Pg 384 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
