404 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Q\072  What is soil testing in real estate\077\nA\072 A geotechnical investigation that analyses the composition\054 load\055bearing capacity\054 and drainage characteristics of land\056\n\nQ\072 Can I ask a developer for a soil testing report\077 \nA\072 Yes\054 and you should\056 A developer who refuses is protecting information you have a right to see\056\n\nQ\072 Does Oltraya publish its soil testing reports\077 \nA\072 Yes\056 The full report for Oltraya Verde is available for download on the project page without requiring registration or a sales conversation\056)
     /K [ 10 ]
     /P 405 0 R
     /Pg 384 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
